        "date": "2026-11-25T15:28:11Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(mcp): do not offer a read-only legacy key in list_operation_types\n\nA key that a params type reads but never writes (skip_serializing, such\nas the legacy wire start hole that the load migrates into picks) is not\nlisted. A serializer trace of the kind's default params gives the keys\nthat the type can write.\n\nRefs #3449\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
